  "prefLabel": "Odb 402.15 Financial statement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 402.15 “Financial statement” means a complete accounting of a facility owner's financial condition prepared in accordance with generally accepted accounting practices or standards including a statement of assets and liabilities, income statement, statement of cash flows, and statement of whether the owner is creditworthy.\n\nSource. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
